       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MOVE-DEMO.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SOURCE-NAME PIC X(10) VALUE "COBOL".
       01 TARGET-NAME PIC X(10).
       01 SHORT-NAME PIC X(2).
       01 STUDENT-MARKS PIC 999.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE SOURCE-NAME TO TARGET-NAME.
           DISPLAY "COPIED VALUE: " TARGET-NAME.
           MOVE SOURCE-NAME TO SHORT-NAME.
           DISPLAY "SHORT VALUE: " SHORT-NAME.
           MOVE 75 TO STUDENT-MARKS.
           DISPLAY "MARKS: " STUDENT-MARKS.
           STOP RUN.
